      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCOOTIN' SCOOBY (2) brought up his 14th career win last start at this track (30.48). Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of five starts. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Expected to be right there at the finish again. ZIPPING LYNDY (1) finds it hard to break through. Finished third (30.95) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Winning chance. MOTOR CITY SONNY (4) won comfortably last time scoring by 6 lengths at this track after jumping from box 5 (30.42). Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from four starts. One of the leading chances again.",
